WEBVTT

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:37.260
Stone-baked sweet potatoes....

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:38.410
Sweet potatoes.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.410
Sweet potatoes, sweet potatoes, sweat potatoes~

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.380
They're sweet and delicious, stone-baked sweet potatoes.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.640
Thank you!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.090
Getting the usual?

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:58.720
Yep!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.850
Poka~n 17

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.850
The Spell of Breaching is Inviting a Love Interest Home

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:10.800
Okay, I'll grab a fat one for you!

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:15.820
Don't fuckin' think you're better than me just 'cause you're a pretty boy.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.720
That's... that's not what I meant.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.990
What? You wanna dance?

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.760
Okay, so this ugly one is the bad guy.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:30.830
It's decided!

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.000
Wha?

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.880
Don't think I'll go easy on you just 'cause you're a gi-

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.200
Oh, thank you so much! You saved me!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.440
Oh, it's nothing.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.160
My name's Liru.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.610
You wanna grab a baked sweet potato with me?

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.690
I was just about to get one from over there.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:01.210
Well then, allow me to pay.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:03.700
As a way of saying thanks.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.950
Oh!

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:11.170
oh, my important CD-ROM...

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.660
Okay, go ahead and choose whichever one you want!

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.170
Huh?

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.600
No matter how I look at it, he's great!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.440
Dammit...

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.690
Then, on the next night.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:37.390
Going all the way to the electronics store in town has made me so late!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:38.160
Um...

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.260
Oh?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:40.700
Yes?

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.650
And you know, I was just about to...

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.160
I don't really know what you're getting at...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:50.940
Liru-san, you have a guest!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.710
For me?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.200
Hm?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.130
Wasn't that just Liru-san's voice?

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.780
Welcome!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:12.440
I'm sorry, it looks like Liru just left the house on an errand or something.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.440
I'm sorry. You went through the trouble of coming all the way out here...

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:21.280
Oh... then, excuse me for tonight.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.950
Oh, but I'm sure she'll be right back, so please, spend some time here!

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.950
The night is still young!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.120
So, what business did you have with Liru?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.490
Well, last night she saved me when I got into a dangerous situation, and...

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.370
Really?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.070
Is that so?

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:45.970
Doesn't the word dan-ger-ous have a nice ring to it?

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.140
The nape of his neck is so nice.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.650
This isn't good... At this rate he'll become Pachira's victim!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:58.620
Fish...
Fish cake?!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:58.620
Damn...
It's hopeless!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.650
I've lost!

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.020
Uma, Uma!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:04.910
Please, please, please!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.720
What? No.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:10.650
Turn me back to normal with your magic!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:13.420
No way! I'm reading manga right now.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.840
I can see that! C'mon, please!

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:18.860
Fine...

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:19.670
Yes!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.890
But don't get mad at me if I mess up.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.650
Of course I'd get mad!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.680
Uh, fine. I won't get mad.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.480
Useless spirits, gather here.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:40.360
Chikutaku, chikutaku~, turn Liru back to normal!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.870
Okay, done!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.570
You aren't done!

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:53.460
What is this?

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:57.210
I can't show myself looking like some kind of girl in a fursuit!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.960
Why should I care? Isn't that fine?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.380
No, that's what I'm trying to tell you!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:06.600
Jeez, I only did it cause you asked! Just get out!

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.930
Hey, Uma? Open up! OPEN UP!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.000
Well, I'll come back tomorrow.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.600
Is that so?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.930
Well then, I'll be awaiting your return.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.940
He came to meet me!

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.390
Dammit...

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:29.240
Tomorrow, I'll also be...

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.490
Moving on to the next night...

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:37.000
Okay, no moon in sight!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.500
Aiko, are the refreshments ready?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.000
It's all ready.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.960
Thank you!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:55.720
Good evening!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.230
One second, I'll let you in!

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.120
Pa-Pachira-san!

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.980
You... what's with those clothes?

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.830
Your panties are showing!

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:09.990
Your bra is showing!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.770
Um... good evening?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:14.700
Ye~s!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.700
I'll open the door!

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.770
Welcome,

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.210
I've been waiting for you!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.500
Ah... Okay.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.480
Come in and make yourself at home!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:30.120
Um, is Liru-san here today?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.470
Oh, Liru?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.090
She'll be right back, so make yourself comfortable!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.230
Until then, I'd be delighted to keep you company!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.660
Ah... I see.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.480
Then as you said, I'll just wait here.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.190
Please do!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.900
That's a very well-behaved dog.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.700
Come here, come here!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.450
Wait, this might be a good chance for me.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.450
That thing'll bite.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:03.460
What?

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.460
You...!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.980
Oh, it looks like there's no problem!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:18.430
Well, it's a bitch, so maybe it's nicer to guys...

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.730
She's quite vicious, though! Please, look at this!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:25.230
She bit me here the day before yesterday...

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.740
And then while I was asleep, here and here, too...

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.740
See?!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.830
What are you doing, you little hussy?!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:43.640
No, I can't let this go on any longer!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.750
Lo-
Lotus root?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:44.750
It's hopeless!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:45.710
I've lost!

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:48.510
Uma, Uma!

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.120
Please, please, please!

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.630
No way.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:55.690
Please, turn me back to normal with your magic right now!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:56.660
I told you no!

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:57.930
I'll mess up anyway.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:01.120
C'mon, don't worry about that. Please!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.440
I won't do it.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:05.200
I'll give you my dinner tomorrow!

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.650
What's for dinner tomorrow?

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.900
I'll make whatever you want, Uma-san!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.250
What?

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.340
Really?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.360
Aiko.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.800
Uma-san, I'm asking you, too.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.460
Pachira just isn't being fair to Liru-san.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:21.770
Whatever I want?

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.300
Then I want meatballs!

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.790
As you wish.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.870
Yay!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.680
Oh, can you make hamburger steak instead?

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.560
Uh, sure, sure.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.220
Okay, here we go!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.730
All done!

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:52.730
This isn't right!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.640
What the hell is this?

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.240
Look at what you've done to me!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.020
Liru-san...

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:00.240
You're disgusting.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.100
Hey, Uma! What're you going to do?

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:05.020
I can't be seen like this!

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.940
Hurry up and fix it!

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:10.250
And Aiko! Don't call me disgusting!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:14.260
No~ No~!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.010
Help me, Uma-san!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:20.140
I'm scared! So gross!

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.120
Both of you, GET OUT!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:28.090
Um... I seem to have come at a bad time. I'll leave now.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.200
What? Oh, please, take your time!

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.150
Well, but...

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:36.720
Ah~!

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.760
Oh, are you okay?

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:39.950
Oh no~!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.150
Oh my! Something like that happening THERE!

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.380
What should we do?

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.630
I'm so wet...

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:46.870
This is so embarrassing!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.200
You should go ahead and take it off!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:51.080
I'll take mine off too!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.160
Yes, let's hurry up and take them off!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.460
Ah~!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.750
Wait just one second!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.090
Goodbye!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:07.670
What?

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.210
Who was that?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.650
What are you doing?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.480
You scared him off!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.820
And what's with that nasty body of yours?

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:16.840
It's not my fault!

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.180
This is Uma's magic's fault!

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.860
And don't call me nasty!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.620
It's your fault?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.870
Huh? Hey, leave me out of this!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.400
Idiot!

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.370
Stupid!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.870
STUPID!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.240
IDIOT!

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.880
Aww~

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.430
Just take it, dummy~

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:01.570
After a seemingly endless wait, today Christmas arrives for Masao-kun and Michiru-chan.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:06.250
"I want a big teddy bear, please!"

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.620
"I want an R/C car, please!"

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.620
So the two asked Santa.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:19.130
Next, to prepare for Santa's arrival, they lovingly decorate the room.

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:23.850
Then they help their mother prepare a feast.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.140
Now, the party begins!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:33.630
To help Santa find the house, they have a lively party.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:39.070
"Now, it's time for good boys and girls to go to sleep."

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:42.570
Masao-kun and Michiru-chan got into bed.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:51.660
Right as everyone nods off to sleep, his reindeer-driven sleigh descended from the sky.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.270
It's Santa!

00:12:54.270 --> 00:13:00.670
Santa squeezed his large body through the chimney opening and slipped down into the fireplace.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:07.200
Santa quietly fills their socks with something.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.680
Then, morning arrived.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:14.380
The two find their presents from Santa and are overjoyed!

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:16.560
"Thank you, Santa!"

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.420
And so, Masao-kun and Michiru-chan spent the rest of the winter

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.930
having fun with the presents they received from Santa.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:29.370
Christmas with Santa

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.070
The end.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:34.370
Pokaan ~ 18

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.400
The White Spell Is Christmas!

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:34.370
The White Spell Is Christmas

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.130
Everyone, did you hear that?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.760
That's great news!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.630
Good job on finding that, Ai-chan!

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:51.390
It was on showcase as the most popular book at the bookstore, so I was curious about it.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.640
Okay, so we need to start with socks!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:54.750
What?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.140
Hey, what're you doing, Uma?

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:58.350
Hm?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.490
It said to use your favorite sock!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.770
My favorite!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:05.160
Not one you're wearing now. Get one that's been washed.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.910
She's right, it's basic etiquette!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.910
Wha? Okay...

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.810
I... don't have any socks.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:24.420
Can someone let me borrow one?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:28.430
Eh? Are someone else's socks okay?

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:33.430
Hm... I don't see anything about that written in here.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.930
Then why not make your own?

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.770
Oh, that's a good idea!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.560
Okay, let's all hang up our socks!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.560
Yeah!

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:47.570
Santa-sama...

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:52.160
Please, give me a Bust Up Machine, the Riyuu 600!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.580
It's a new model!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.080
Santa-san, I want a clown-style magic baton!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:02.580
Santa-san, for me, a year's supply of Matsuzaka beef!

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.260
I hope I can make it on time...

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:17.820
Well, for now, I'd like my memory capacity to be upgraded!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.740
Um... okay, now we decorate!

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:22.520
Yeah!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.020
Welcome, Satanta-san

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:32.990
Something like this?

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.790
Yeah... let's make some food now.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:37.950
Well then, I guess we should get Aiko...

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.420
Ai-chan! Food! Fo-o-d!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.810
Uma-san!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.420
Perfect timing!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.930
How is it? My sock!

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:56.540
Um...I wonder if he'll realize that's a sock...

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:59.270
What? That's....

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.770
Then, I'll remake it.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.890
Later, later! We need food first!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:05.790
But...

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.440
I got it!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.280
Ai-chan, leave it to me!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.280
What? Whaaat?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.040
Okay, let's make some food!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.470
Yeah!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.920
Merry~
Satanta

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.370
It's all done!

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:40.730
We didn't screw anything up, did we?

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.310
It's just fine!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.440
Now we just need to have a party and go to bed,

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:50.170
then Santa will come down our chimney and leave presents in our socks!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.120
That's our chimney, isn't it?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.280
Can Santa get through that?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.330
Um... it might not be possible...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.240
Then do we need to make a chimney right now?

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:07.250
I'm pretty hungry right now...

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:08.560
Just wait!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.440
Eh?

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.640
Which is more important, that or Christmas presents?

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:13.520
Uh...

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.040
You'd be okay with Santa not coming?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.780
I'll wait...

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.380
So where do we put it?

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.270
He comes in on a sleigh from the sky, right?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.950
Then that means...

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.960
Stop, stop, stop!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.030
You guys, what are you doing?

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.640
We're making a chimney.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.530
This is the only good place to make it, right?

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.800
Are you kidding me?

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.560
Why is my room going to be the chimney?

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.040
Aiko, say something!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.250
What?

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:51.000
Um... Pachira-san, don't you want presents from Santa?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.670
Why do I even need to explain to you guys why this is a bad idea?

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.050
Pachira!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.530
What are you doing?

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.430
You really did it...!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.180
Very well! Bri--

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.810
Um...

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:14.010
Please don't fall. You're on top of the roof!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.070
This isn't going to get us anywhere...

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.500
I give up...

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.490
I'm hungry...

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:32.590
I'll let you off for today...

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:36.110
Okay, let's make up at the party!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.420
Okay...

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.760
Hey!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.430
Hello.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.440
I've gone ahead and started eating.

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:49.840
Wha?

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.520
Now, now, go right ahead!

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:01.930
Drink, drink!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.060
I made this myself!

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:07.500
Don't hesitate to let me know if you need anything else!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.710
Oh, I've had more than enough!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.860
You must be tired after your long trip!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.000
We thought you would come by sleigh...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.580
You did a great job finding us!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.010
We were still working on the chimney!

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.540
Oh, I was fine!

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.530
You're being so nice to me, even though I just barged right in.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:27.530
Oh, what are you saying?

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.280
We were all waiting for you!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:29.980
What?

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.810
Really?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:36.020
Well then, I need to give you something in return.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.400
Oh, your feelings are-

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.810
Drink up!

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:45.940
Hey, hey, do you know what Matsuzaka beef is?

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.970
It's so delicious...

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:52.280
Ah, you want to eat some? Okay, leave it to me!

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:58.130
I.... I'm actually self-conscious about my chest.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.200
Eh?

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.340
Okay, I'll make 'em bigger!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:08.270
Oh, I wanted a clown-style baton!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.200
Oh, I see. You like clowns, huh?

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.270
okay!

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:18.280
Um, I wanted a hard disk upgrade...

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.840
Eh?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.280
Hard dicks?

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.860
What?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.980
I'm sorry, I don't know any foreign languages!

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:28.040
Can you explain in Japanese?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:33.830
Um, it's for storage, no... for storing more information.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.520
I have no idea.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.790
Your request is boring, missy.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.270
Well, anyway!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.790
Yes, yes!

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:45.230
Drink, drink!

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.860
No, I've had my fill.

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:47.660
What?

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:50.960
Okay... well, I'm stuffed.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.120
But, you still have...

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.050
I'm sorry, coming in and eating all your food.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:57.020
Oh, it was nothing!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.460
You girls are all so wonderful.

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.560
Your wishes will definitely come true.

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:10.160
Bye-bye!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.670
Bye-bye!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:32.890
Ah... that's the first time in a while I've had a real meal.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.890
Okay, time to go to sleep.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:43.190
Oh, I forgot my sleeping bag!

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:50.710
Baton... the clown-style baton... where is it?

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:52.140
Good evening!

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:55.780
It's now midnight on December the 30th!

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:58.250
Only two more days until the New Year!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.820
Everyone, are you prepared for the New Year?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:03.960
This year has just flown by!

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:04.270
It sure has!

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:06.490
Okay, time for the next song!

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:08.390
Here we go!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.850
Next Pokaan···

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:43.360
Have you ever gone to a hot spring and gone home without even going in once?

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:47.030
You just drink and drink, and before you know it, you check out!

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:49.660
Or something like that.
